WEBVTT

00:08:28.996 --> 00:08:30.636
and we long for the Beloved,

00:08:30.676 --> 00:08:34.516
which is the beautiful word
the Sufis have for God.

00:08:34.556 --> 00:08:39.556
So sometime after I left
my law firm and the musician,

00:08:39.596 --> 00:08:42.156
I met Ken, who would become my husband.

00:08:43.036 --> 00:08:44.316
Ken is a writer, too,

00:08:44.316 --> 00:08:46.516
and he had spent the past decade

00:08:46.556 --> 00:08:48.796
doing UN peacekeeping negotiations

00:08:48.836 --> 00:08:52.516
in Rwanda and Liberia and Somalia.

00:08:53.116 --> 00:08:54.636
And he had done that work

00:08:54.676 --> 00:08:58.196
because underneath
his very exuberant personality,

00:08:58.196 --> 00:09:01.756
he was filled with his own longing
for another world.